' Management activity, aligned with the seeded workflow (V10 + V41) and
' docs/200-architecture/203-design/GESTION.md.
' Not the source of truth for states (ADR-027). That is CICLO-DE-VIDA.md §3.1.
' Signing the deed and the registration draft are not edges of this activity.
@startuml
title Management activity

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam activity {
  BackgroundColor #F6EBD8
  BorderColor #333333
  FontColor #111111
  DiamondBackgroundColor #F6EBD8
  DiamondBorderColor #333333
}

start

:The client requests a procedure;
:The clerk identifies the client and the budget\n(CU61, CU60, CU01);
:Start the management;
:POST /api/v1/managements/complete-case;
:Management is Iniciada;

:Transition "Procedures are assigned";
:En Tramite;

:Client documents and external-entity documents\n(CU04, CU10);
:Transition "Documents submitted";
:Documentacion Completa;

if (Archive without a deed?) then (yes)
  :POST /api/v1/managements/{id}/archive;
  if (A folder is in Espera and not confirmed?) then (yes)
    :409 — the management does not change;
    stop
  else (no)
    :Balance above zero: warning, it does not block;
    :Archivada;
    stop
  endif
else (continue with the deed)
endif

:Transition "The deed is drafted";
:Gestion con Escritura Sin Firmar;

note right
  POST /api/v1/deeds/{id}/sign
  sets deeds.status to Firmada.
  It does not move this node.
end note

:Transition "The parties sign";
:Gestion con Escritura Firmada;

:Transition "The testimony is generated";
:Testimonio Generado;

:Transition "Submitted for registration";
:Testimonio Ingresado a Inscripcion;

:Transition "Withdrawn";
:Testimonio Retirado;
stop
@enduml
